OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLargely
OL,6,Fcloudy to start the night, with
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain and drizzle over the
OL,8,FPennines and Cheviots. Some clear
OL,9,Fspells developing later, allowing some
OL,10,Ffog patches to form by the morning.
OL,11,FWinds remain light.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FFog patches will clear to
OL,14,Fpartly cloudy skies during the
OL,15,Fmorning. Some longer sunny intervals
OL,16,Fdevelop during the afternoon,
OL,17,Fespecially along the coast. A light or
OL,18,Fgentle breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
