OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FSettled
OL,6,Fand mostly dry in the coming days.
OL,7,FLight winds allow fog patches to form
OL,8,Fduring the morning; these slowly
OL,9,Fburning away to give some sunny
OL,10,Fspells. Temperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
